From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mmc: ingenic: use DMA for all data transfers

Small transfers (sg_len == 1 and length < PIO_THRESHOLD, 64 bytes) are
switched to the PIO path, whose read handler hangs waiting for
STAT_DATA_TRAN_DONE. SDIO function drivers issue small CMD53 transfers, so
the card enumerates but every data access times out. Use the DMA path for
all data by lowering the auto-PIO threshold to 0.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
 drivers/mmc/host/ingenic_mmc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/mmc/host/ingenic_mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/ingenic_mmc.c
@@ -42,1 +42,1 @@
-#define PIO_THRESHOLD		64	/* use pio mode if data length < PIO_THRESHOLD */
+#define PIO_THRESHOLD		0	/* use pio mode if data length < PIO_THRESHOLD */
